  "synopsis": "Sankaku no Sekai is a silent science-fiction short film produced by the Shinshin Kinema company. The plot follows a grand, ominous convention held by the bizarre inhabitants of the \"Triangular World,\" who gather to scheme the total annihilation of the human race. Meanwhile, the people of Earth must frantically devise a counter-strategy to defend their planet from the impending alien invasion.\n\n(Source: Nihon Animation Eigashi, translated, edited)",
